# Collaboration examples

Use a collaboration (multiple pools + message flows) only when the description involves multiple independent participants exchanging messages. Otherwise, use a single `{"process": [...]}`.

Textual description:
"A customer places an order with a supplier. The supplier checks availability and sends a confirmation back to the customer."

```json
{
    "participants": [
        {
            "id": "customer",
            "name": "Customer",
            "process": [
                {"type": "startEvent", "id": "c_start"},
                {"type": "sendTask", "id": "c_order", "label": "Place order"},
                {"type": "receiveTask", "id": "c_recv", "label": "Receive confirmation"},
                {"type": "endEvent", "id": "c_end"}
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "supplier",
            "name": "Supplier",
            "process": [
                {"type": "startEvent", "id": "s_start", "eventDefinition": "messageEventDefinition"},
                {"type": "userTask", "id": "s_check", "label": "Check availability"},
                {"type": "sendTask", "id": "s_confirm", "label": "Send confirmation"},
                {"type": "endEvent", "id": "s_end"}
            ]
        }
    ],
    "message_flows": [
        {"id": "mf1", "sourceRef": "c_order", "targetRef": "s_start", "label": "Order"},
        {"id": "mf2", "sourceRef": "s_confirm", "targetRef": "c_recv", "label": "Confirmation"}
    ]
}
```

Textual description:
"A job applicant submits an application to the HR department. HR reviews it; if accepted, HR sends an offer to the applicant, otherwise HR sends a rejection."

```json
{
    "participants": [
        {
            "id": "applicant",
            "name": "Applicant",
            "process": [
                {"type": "startEvent", "id": "a_start"},
                {"type": "sendTask", "id": "a_submit", "label": "Submit application"},
                {"type": "receiveTask", "id": "a_result", "label": "Receive decision"},
                {"type": "endEvent", "id": "a_end"}
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "hr",
            "name": "HR Department",
            "process": [
                {"type": "startEvent", "id": "h_start", "eventDefinition": "messageEventDefinition"},
                {"type": "userTask", "id": "h_review", "label": "Review application"},
                {
                    "type": "exclusiveGateway",
                    "id": "h_decide",
                    "label": "Application accepted?",
                    "has_join": false,
                    "branches": [
                        {
                            "condition": "Accepted",
                            "path": [
                                {"type": "sendTask", "id": "h_offer", "label": "Send offer"},
                                {"type": "endEvent", "id": "h_end_ok"}
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "condition": "Rejected",
                            "path": [
                                {"type": "sendTask", "id": "h_reject", "label": "Send rejection"},
                                {"type": "endEvent", "id": "h_end_no"}
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "message_flows": [
        {"id": "mf1", "sourceRef": "a_submit", "targetRef": "h_start", "label": "Application"},
        {"id": "mf2", "sourceRef": "h_offer", "targetRef": "a_result", "label": "Offer"},
        {"id": "mf3", "sourceRef": "h_reject", "targetRef": "a_result", "label": "Rejection"}
    ]
}
```
